    {
      "s": 15.94,
      "e": 17.83,
      "text": "- So during a man overboard, that department"
    },
    {
      "s": 17.83,
      "e": 19.61,
      "text": "will man up both of our boat decks."
    },
    {
      "s": 19.61,
      "e": 20.76,
      "text": "Typically the starboard side"
    },
    {
      "s": 20.76,
      "e": 23.36,
      "text": "is going to be our primary lifeboat."
    },
    {
      "s": 23.36,
      "e": 25.86,
      "text": "We'll load the lifeboat with the coxswain,"
    },
    {
      "s": 25.86,
      "e": 28.22,
      "text": "the boat driver, the boat engineer,"
    },
    {
      "s": 28.22,
      "e": 31.66,
      "text": "the boat officer, who's overall in charge and responsible,"
    },
    {
      "s": 31.66,
      "e": 33.56,
      "text": "as well as the surface rescue swimmer."
    },
    {
      "s": 35.64,
      "e": 38.01,
      "text": "- Uh, a SAR swimmer is somebody that is"
    },
    {
      "s": 38.01,
      "e": 39.6,
      "text": "uh, going to go out of their way"
    },
    {
      "s": 39.6,
      "e": 43.46,
      "text": "to possibly save a man that has jumped overboard."
    },
    {
      "s": 43.46,
      "e": 44.7,
      "text": "We do all kinds of stuff."
    },
    {
      "s": 44.7,
      "e": 47.5,
      "text": "(upbeat rock music)"
    },
    {
      "s": 47.5,
      "e": 49.05,
      "text": "Depending on the water temperature,"
    },
    {
      "s": 49.05,
      "e": 52.84,
      "text": "uh, we'll deploy with a wetsuit or a drysuit."
    },
    {
      "s": 52.84,
      "e": 54.67,
      "text": "Also, we'll put on a harness."
    },
    {
      "s": 54.67,
      "e": 57.74,
      "text": "The harness will have four chem-lights on 'em,"
    },
    {
      "s": 57.74,
      "e": 61.67,
      "text": "a knife, and uh, also a J-hook."
    },
    {
      "s": 61.67,
      "e": 63.85,
      "text": "We also have fins that we take out there."
    },
    {
      "s": 63.85,
      "e": 66.78,
      "text": "Uh, and a mask with a snorkel on it."
    },
    {
      "s": 66.78,
      "e": 69.89,
      "text": "(upbeat rock music)"
    },
    {
      "s": 69.89,
      "e": 73.4,
      "text": "We need SAR swimmers on board so if anybody,"
    },
    {
      "s": 74.48,
      "e": 77.94,
      "text": "if anybody falls overboard during flight operations,"
    },
    {
      "s": 77.94,
      "e": 80.73,
      "text": "uh, we can go and retrieve them."
    },
    {
      "s": 80.73,
      "e": 84.22,
      "text": "(upbeat rock music)"
    },
    {
      "s": 84.22,
      "e": 86.43,
      "text": "- [Lt. Anderson] It's just rewarding knowing that we are,"
    },
    {
      "s": 86.43,
